"Click Presenting to see how many apps are hidden, or to stop." = "按一下「簡報中」即可查看隱藏了多少個 App，或停止簡報。";
"If the camera or microphone turns on, hiding pauses once so macOS can show which app uses it." = "若相機或麥克風開啟，隱藏會暫停一次，讓 macOS 能顯示是哪個 App 在使用。";
"Hiding keeps going when the camera or microphone turns on, as set in Settings." = "依「設定」中的選項，相機或麥克風開啟時仍會繼續隱藏。";
"Got it" = "知道了";
"How it works" = "運作方式";
"Start it with the shortcut above, the arrow's right-click menu, or automatically when a display is mirrored." = "可用上方的快速鍵或箭頭的右鍵選單來啟動，或在顯示器鏡像輸出時自動啟動。";
"While it is on, every third-party app icon is hidden. macOS's own items stay. Reveal gestures and the new-app question wait." = "開啟期間，所有第三方 App 的圖示都會隱藏。macOS 本身的項目會保留顯示。顯示手勢與新 App 詢問會暫時停用。";
"\"Find a hidden icon\" leaves sensitive apps out of its list too." = "\"尋找隱藏的圖示\" 的清單中也不會列出敏感 App。";
"If \"Show all icons when the microphone or camera turns on\" is on, a camera or microphone that turns on while you present pauses hiding once, so macOS can show which app uses it. Nothing is hidden meanwhile, sensitive apps included. Hiding resumes when you click Hide again or collapse the bar, or when the camera and microphone turn off. A camera or microphone already on when you start does not pause it. With the switch off, hiding never pauses." = "若開啟 \"麥克風或相機開啟時顯示所有圖示\"，簡報期間開啟的相機或麥克風會讓隱藏暫停一次，讓 macOS 能顯示是哪個 App 在使用。在此期間不會隱藏任何項目，敏感 App 也不例外。按一下「再次隱藏」或收合選單列，或相機與麥克風都關閉時，就會恢復隱藏。開始簡報時已經開啟的相機或麥克風不會讓隱藏暫停。關閉此開關時，隱藏永遠不會暫停。";
"Stop it from the Presenting capsule, the shortcut, or the right-click menu. An automatic start also ends when mirroring stops." = "可從「簡報中」膠囊、快速鍵或右鍵選單停止。自動啟動的簡報也會在鏡像輸出停止時結束。";
"Edit..." = "編輯⋯";
"None" = "無";
"Choose the apps that stay hidden while presenting, even when you click the arrow, except while hiding is paused for the camera or microphone." = "選擇簡報時保持隱藏的 App，即使按一下箭頭也一樣，但相機或麥克風導致隱藏暫停時除外。";
"Apps with a menu bar icon appear here once Hidden Bar has seen them." = "有選單列圖示的 App 在 Hidden Bar 偵測到後，就會顯示在這裡。";
"Right-click on the arrow" = "在箭頭上按右鍵";
"Show menu" = "顯示選單";
"Show always-hidden icons" = "顯示持續隱藏的圖示";
"Option-right-click the arrow to open the menu." = "按住 Option 鍵並在箭頭上按右鍵即可打開選單。";
"Hidden Bar from the App Store is running. Quit it and switch to this version?" = "App Store 版的 Hidden Bar 正在執行。要結束它並切換到此版本嗎？";
"Only one Hidden Bar can run at a time. The App Store version stays installed until you choose otherwise." = "同一時間只能執行一個 Hidden Bar。在您另作選擇之前，App Store 版會保持安裝。";
"Hidden Bar %@ is running. Quit it and switch to this version?" = "Hidden Bar %@ 正在執行。要結束它並切換到此版本嗎？";
"Only one Hidden Bar can run at a time. The older version stays where it is until you choose otherwise." = "同一時間只能執行一個 Hidden Bar。在您另作選擇之前，舊版本會保留在原處。";
"Quit and Switch" = "結束並切換";
"Cancel" = "取消";
"Import your settings from the App Store version?" = "要從 App Store 版輸入您的設定嗎？";
"Hidden Bar from the App Store keeps its settings in a separate place. Import them so this version starts the way you set it up." = "App Store 版的 Hidden Bar 會將設定儲存在另一個位置。輸入後，此版本會以您設定好的方式啟動。";
"Import" = "匯入";
"Not now" = "現在不要";
"Move the App Store copy to the Trash?" = "要將 App Store 版拷貝移到垃圾桶嗎？";
"The App Store version of Hidden Bar is still installed:\n%@\nYou can restore it from the Trash later." = "App Store 版的 Hidden Bar 仍然安裝著：\n%@\n您稍後可以從垃圾桶將其放回。";
"Move to Trash" = "移到垃圾桶";
"Hidden Bar could not move the App Store copy to the Trash" = "Hidden Bar 無法將 App Store 版拷貝移到垃圾桶";
"Drag it to the Trash in Finder instead:\n%@" = "請改在 Finder 中將其拖到垃圾桶：\n%@";
"The App Store copy is in /Applications. Quit Hidden Bar, move /Applications/Hidden Bar.app to the Trash, drag this copy into Applications, then open it from there." = "App Store 版拷貝位於 /Applications。請結束 Hidden Bar，將 /Applications/Hidden Bar.app 移到垃圾桶，把此拷貝拖到「應用程式」檔案夾，然後從那裡打開。";
"This account can't add apps to /Applications. Ask an administrator to drag Hidden Bar into /Applications, then open it from there." = "此帳號無法將 App 加入 /Applications。請讓管理員將 Hidden Bar 拖到 /Applications，然後從那裡打開。";
"Hidden Bar is running from outside Applications. The copy already in Applications goes to the Trash, then Hidden Bar relaunches from there." = "Hidden Bar 正在「應用程式」檔案夾之外執行。「應用程式」中已有的拷貝會被移到垃圾桶，然後 Hidden Bar 會從那裡重新啟動。";
"Hidden Bar is running from outside Applications. Move it there so it keeps working after you empty Downloads, then relaunch." = "Hidden Bar 正在「應用程式」檔案夾之外執行。請將它移到「應用程式」，這樣清空「下載項目」後仍能正常使用，然後重新啟動。";
"Move Hidden Bar to the Applications folder?" = "要將 Hidden Bar 移到「應用程式」檔案夾嗎？";
"Move to Applications" = "移到「應用程式」";
"Hidden Bar can hide icons only from /Applications" = "Hidden Bar 只能在 /Applications 中隱藏圖示";
"a temporary folder" = "暫存檔案夾";
"Hidden Bar cannot hide icons on macOS 27" = "Hidden Bar 無法在 macOS 27 上隱藏圖示";
"macOS 27 no longer lets App Store apps hide menu-bar icons. Hidden Bar from github.com/consolelabs/hidden (free, open source) works on macOS 27." = "macOS 27 不再允許 App Store 的 App 隱藏選單列圖示。github.com/consolelabs/hidden 上的 Hidden Bar（免費、開放原始碼）可在 macOS 27 上使用。";
"Open github.com/consolelabs/hidden" = "打開 github.com/consolelabs/hidden";
"Don't show again" = "不再顯示";
"Hidden Bar on macOS 27" = "macOS 27 上的 Hidden Bar";
"macOS 27: get the working version..." = "macOS 27：取得可用版本...";
"Or install it with Homebrew:" = "或使用 Homebrew 安裝：";
"Quit this App Store version and move it to the Trash first. Homebrew does not install over it." = "請先結束此 App Store 版並將其移到垃圾桶。Homebrew 無法覆蓋安裝。";
"Hiding is paused" = "已暫停隱藏";
"macOS hides these icons whatever Hidden Bar allows: %@. They sit right of the arrow, so the pause switch in Advanced keeps everything visible while they are there." = "無論 Hidden Bar 是否允許，macOS 都會隱藏這些圖示：%@。它們位於箭頭右側，因此只要它們還在那裡，「進階」中的暫停開關就會讓所有圖示保持可見。";
"icons with no name" = "沒有名稱的圖示";
"Nothing to hide" = "沒有可隱藏的項目";
"Every icon is right of the arrow, so there is nothing to hide. Hold Command and drag the arrow to the right of the icons you want to hide." = "所有圖示都在箭頭右側，因此沒有可隱藏的項目。按住 Command 鍵並將箭頭拖到想隱藏的圖示右側。";
